### ==========================================================
### STATS — gasto agregado (para "gastos hormiga")
### El agrupamiento por día usa la timezone del usuario.
### ==========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = tester@test.com
@password = SecureP@ss123

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Gasto por categoría (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/spending?groupBy=category
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Gasto por día (tz-aware)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/spending?groupBy=day
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Gasto por tag
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/spending?groupBy=tag
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Con rango de fechas
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/spending?groupBy=category&from=2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z&to=2026-09-01T00:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Por tipo INCOME
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/spending?groupBy=category&type=INCOME
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Casos de error ----------

### groupBy inválido (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/spending?groupBy=nope
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sin token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/spending?groupBy=category
